      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-268",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ");"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-269",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-270",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Explanation:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-276",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-271",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Standard JavaScript conditional rendering (`&&`) is used."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-272",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If `viewType` is 'table', the `<GenericBlockTable>` component is rendered."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-273",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If `viewType` is 'list', `<GenericBlockListItem>` components are rendered inside a `div`."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-274",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If `viewType` is 'grid', `<GenericBlockCard>` components are rendered inside a grid `div`."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-275",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The `processedData` and relevant schema info are passed down to the active view component."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-277",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Schema Source (Connecting to Chapter 4):**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-278",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Remember the `schema` prop? Where does it come from? In our app, it's designed to be loaded dynamically from the Convex backend."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-279",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-280",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// File: app/notes/page.tsx (Simplified Schema Fetching)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-281",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "'use client';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-282",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import { useQuery } from 'convex/react';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-283",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import { api } from '@/convex/_generated/api';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-284",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import NotionViewEnhanced from '@/app/components/notion/notion-view-enhanced';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-285",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import { useMemo } from 'react';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-286",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "export default function NotesPage() {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-287",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const tenantId = 'tenant-1';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-288",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const userId = 'user-abc';"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-289",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const nodeType = 'note'; // We want the schema for 'note' nodes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-290",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Fetch actual note data (Nodes)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-291",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const notes = useQuery(api.nodes.getVisibleNodes, { tenantId, userId });"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-292",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Fetch the schema definition for 'note' type from Convex"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-293",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const schemaQueryResult = useQuery(api.schemas.getSchema, {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "tenantId,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-295",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "nodeType,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-296",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "});"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-297",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Extract the properties array from the fetched schema document"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-298",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const dynamicSchemaProperties = useMemo("
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-299",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "() => schemaQueryResult?.properties ?? [], // Default to empty array if loading/not found"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-300",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[schemaQueryResult],"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-301",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ");"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-302",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Transform Convex node data into the format NotionViewEnhanced expects"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-303",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const processedData = useMemo(() => {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-304",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (!notes) return [];"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-305",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "return notes.map((note) => ({"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-306",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: note._id, // Use Convex ID"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-307",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "properties: {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-308",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// Map node fields to schema property IDs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-309",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "title: note.genericMetadata?.name ?? 'Untitled',"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-310",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "description: note.genericMetadata?.description ?? '',"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-311",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// ... map other properties based on dynamicSchemaProperties ..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-312",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-313",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}));"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-314",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}, [notes]);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-315",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "if (notes === undefined || schemaQueryResult === undefined) {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-316",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "return <div>Loading...</div>; // Show loading state"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-317",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-318",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "return ("
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-319",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<NotionViewEnhanced"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-320",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "schema={dynamicSchemaProperties} // Pass the fetched schema"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-321",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "data={processedData} // Pass the formatted data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-322",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "titlePropertyId=\"title\" // Assuming 'title' is always the ID for the main name"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-323",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "defaultViewType=\"list\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-324",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "/>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-325",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ");"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-326",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-327",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-328",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Explanation:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-332",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-329",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We use `useQuery` twice: once to get the actual `notes` data (`api.nodes.getVisibleNodes`), and again to get the `schema` definition specifically for the 'note' type (`api.schemas.getSchema`)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-330",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The `schemaQueryResult.properties` array (fetched from the `schemas` table in Convex) is passed as the `schema` prop to `NotionViewEnhanced`."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-331",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The fetched `notes` data needs to be slightly transformed (using `useMemo` and `.map()`) into the `[{ id: '...', properties: {...} }]` structure that `NotionViewEnhanced` expects."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-333",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This dynamic loading of the schema allows different types of data (notes, tasks, companies) to use the same `NotionViewEnhanced` component, each with its own set of properties and display configurations!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-334",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-335",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You've now learned how our application displays structured data in a flexible, Notion-like way!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-342",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-336",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The goal is to view the same data through different lenses (Table, List, Grid)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-337",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`NotionViewEnhanced` is the central component that manages these views."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-338",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It takes a `schema` (defining the data structure/properties) and the actual `data` as input."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-339",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The `schema` often comes dynamically from our [Chapter 4: Convex Backend (Nodes & Edges)](https://www.notion.so/turtlelabs/04_convex_backend__nodes___edges__.md) (`schemas` table)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-340",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The `data` is fetched from Convex (e.g., `nodes` table) and formatted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-341",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`NotionViewEnhanced` handles view switching, filtering, sorting, and property visibility using internal state and sub-components like `GenericBlockTable`, `GenericBlockCard`, and `GenericBlockListItem`."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-343",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We now have a way to store data (Convex) and display it flexibly (`NotionViewEnhanced`). What about interacting with data in a more conversational way, perhaps using Artificial Intelligence?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-344",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let's move on to [Chapter 6: AI Chat Interface](https://www.notion.so/turtlelabs/06_ai_chat_interface_.md) to explore how we build a chat experience!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-345",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-346",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Generated by [AI Codebase Knowledge Builder](https://github.com/The-Pocket/Tutorial-Codebase-Knowledge)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}